   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 我们Fenfen，在这颗你们称为「图托恩」的星球上，已经生活了无数纪元。"
  },
  {
   "side": "sfw",
   "archive": "cosmobreeder-multi.jar",
   "entry": "vsn/11",
   "line": 22,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 安静谦逊，最适合形容我们Fenfen。"
  },
  {
   "side": "sfw",
   "archive": "cosmobreeder-multi.jar",
   "entry": "vsn/11",
   "line": 39,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 她很轻易便获准接触我们Fenfen所封存的力量贮藏。"
  },
  {
   "side": "sfw",
   "archive": "cosmobreeder-multi.jar",
   "entry": "vsn/125",
   "line": 16,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 我们Fenfen，在你们称作“图托恩”的星球上已生活了无数岁月。"
  },
  {
   "side": "sfw",
   "archive": "cosmobreeder-multi.jar",
