   "line": 37,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 任何无法躲进我们曾称之为家的阴影之下的Fenfen"
  },
  {
   "side": "sfw",
   "archive": "cosmobreeder-multi.jar",
   "entry": "vsn/131",
   "line": 44,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 那种残暴，在我们Fenfen漫长的历史中闻所未闻"
  },
  {
   "side": "sfw",
   "archive": "cosmobreeder-multi.jar",
   "entry": "vsn/137",
   "line": 11,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 当黑暗势力降临到全体Fenfen——无论老幼——头上时，"
  },
  {
   "side": "sfw",
   "archive": "cosmobreeder-multi.jar",
   "entry": "vsn/137",
   "line": 24,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 如今要用来反抗那些妄图奴役我们Fenfen的敌人！"
  },
  {
   "side": "sfw",
   "archive": "cosmobreeder-multi.jar",
   "entry": "vsn/137",
   "line": 37,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 有些如高贵的精灵，拿起古老兵器援助我们Fenfen……"
  },
