   "side": "sfw",
   "archive": "cosmobreeder-multi.jar",
   "entry": "vsn/143",
   "line": 38,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 但这并不意味着Fenfen迎来了凯旋时刻……"
  },
  {
   "side": "sfw",
   "archive": "cosmobreeder-multi.jar",
   "entry": "vsn/143",
   "line": 43,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 你降落的这颗星球，已不再是Fenfen宁静的家园，"
  },
  {
   "side": "sfw",
   "archive": "cosmobreeder-multi.jar",
   "entry": "vsn/143",
   "line": 45,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 至今，仍有许多Fenfen被那些妄图征服我们的残党囚禁"
  },
  {
   "side": "sfw",
   "archive": "cosmobreeder-multi.jar",
   "entry": "vsn/149",
   "line": 12,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 当我们Fenfen努力重建家园、驱逐邪恶的残余势力时，"
  },
  {
   "side": "sfw",
   "archive": "cosmobreeder-multi.jar",
   "entry": "vsn/149",
   "line": 18,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 又或许，命运还想对饱受苦难的我们Fenfen开一个更加阴险的玩笑，"
  },
