   "side": "sfw",
   "archive": "cosmobreeder-multi.jar",
   "entry": "vsn/155",
   "line": 24,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): ……即便是Fenfen中最智慧的头脑，也无法在如此众多的战线上同时作战。"
  },
