   "text": "lang(Fox): 纷纷逃离Fenfen议会的力量。"
  },
  {
   "side": "sfw",
   "archive": "cosmobreeder-multi.jar",
   "entry": "vsn/29",
   "line": 38,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 这并不是说，对Fenfen而言这是一个凯旋的时刻……"
  },
  {
   "side": "sfw",
   "archive": "cosmobreeder-multi.jar",
   "entry": "vsn/29",
   "line": 43,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 你所登陆的这颗星球，已不再是Fenfen那宁静的家园，"
  },
  {
   "side": "sfw",
   "archive": "cosmobreeder-multi.jar",
   "entry": "vsn/29",
   "line": 45,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 至今仍有许多Fenfen被那些妄图征服者的残部俘虏着，"
  },
  {
   "side": "sfw",
   "archive": "cosmobreeder-multi.jar",
   "entry": "vsn/35",
   "line": 12,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 当我们Fenfen奋力重建家园、驱逐邪恶残部时，"
  },
  {
   "side": "sfw",
   "archive": "cosmobreeder-multi.jar",
   "entry": "vsn/35",
   "line": 18,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 又或许，命运对受苦的我们Fenfen还有更阴险的玩笑要开，"
  },
  {
   "side": "sfw",
   "archive": "cosmobreeder-multi.jar",
   "entry": "vsn/41",
   "line": 24,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): ……就连Fenfen中最睿智的人，也无法同时应付这么多方面的压力。"
  },
  {
   "side": "sfw",
   "archive": "cosmobreeder-multi.jar",
   "entry": "vsn/41",
   "line": 28,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 一旦没有了Fenfen议会的力量来囚禁Traeh，"
  },
  {
   "side": "sfw",
   "archive": "cosmobreeder-multi.jar",
   "entry": "vsn/41",
   "line": 45,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 还是说，你会成为Fenfen的救主，一座勇气与希望的灯塔……？"
  },
