   "line": 49,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "text: 个子小，耳朵大……这肯定就是那些Fenfen中的一个了！"
  },
  {
   "side": "nsfw",
   "archive": "patch.pak",
   "entry": "vsn/263",
   "line": 16,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 我们Fenfen，在你们称作“图托恩”的星球上已生活了无数岁月。"
  },
  {
   "side": "nsfw",
   "archive": "patch.pak",
   "entry": "vsn/263",
   "line": 22,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 安静谦逊，最适合形容我们Fenfen。"
  },
  {
   "side": "nsfw",
   "archive": "patch.pak",
   "entry": "vsn/263",
   "line": 39,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 她顺利获准接触我们Fenfen储存的力量。"
  },
  {
   "side": "nsfw",
   "archive": "patch.pak",
   "entry": "vsn/269",
   "line": 37,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 任何无法躲进我们曾称之为家的阴影之下的Fenfen"
  },
  {
   "side": "nsfw",
   "archive": "patch.pak",
   "entry": "vsn/269",
   "line": 44,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 那种残暴，在我们Fenfen漫长的历史中闻所未闻"
  },
  {
   "side": "nsfw",
   "archive": "patch.pak",
   "entry": "vsn/275",
   "line": 11,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 当黑暗势力降临到全体Fenfen——无论老幼——头上时，"
  },
  {
   "side": "nsfw",
   "archive": "patch.pak",
   "entry": "vsn/275",
   "line": 24,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 如今要用来反抗那些妄图奴役我们Fenfen的敌人！"
  },
  {
   "side": "nsfw",
   "archive": "patch.pak",
   "entry": "vsn/275",
   "line": 37,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 有些如高贵的精灵，拿起古老兵器援助我们Fenfen……"
  },
  {
   "side": "nsfw",
   "archive": "patch.pak",
   "entry": "vsn/281",
   "line": 13,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 和这片土地上原本爱好和平的Fenfen。"
  },
  {
   "side": "nsfw",
   "archive": "patch.pak",
   "entry": "vsn/281",
   "line": 18,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 议会失去了一位代表重要力量的 Fenfen 核心成员，"
  },
  {
   "side": "nsfw",
   "archive": "patch.pak",
   "entry": "vsn/281",
   "line": 37,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 仓皇逃离Fenfen议会的力量。"
  },
  {
   "side": "nsfw",
   "archive": "patch.pak",
   "entry": "vsn/281",
   "line": 38,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 这并不是说，对Fenfen而言这是一个凯旋的时刻……"
  },
  {
   "side": "nsfw",
   "archive": "patch.pak",
   "entry": "vsn/281",
   "line": 43,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 你降落的星球，已不再是Fenfen的和平家园，"
  },
  {
   "side": "nsfw",
   "archive": "patch.pak",
   "entry": "vsn/281",
   "line": 45,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 至今，仍有许多Fenfen被那些妄图征服我们的残党囚禁"
  },
  {
   "side": "nsfw",
   "archive": "patch.pak",
   "entry": "vsn/287",
   "line": 12,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 当我们Fenfen努力重建家园、驱逐邪恶的残余势力时，"
  },
  {
   "side": "nsfw",
   "archive": "patch.pak",
   "entry": "vsn/287",
   "line": 18,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): 又或许，命运还想对饱受苦难的我们Fenfen开一个更加阴险的玩笑，"
  },
  {
   "side": "nsfw",
   "archive": "patch.pak",
   "entry": "vsn/293",
   "line": 24,
   "kind": "line",
   "count": 1,
   "actor_slot": false,
   "text": "lang(Fox): ……即便是Fenfen中最智慧的头脑，也无法在如此众多的战线上同时作战。"
